{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"一、三十有一年，春，築臺于郎。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？臨民之所漱浣也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"二、夏四月，薛伯卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"三、築臺于薛。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？遠也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"四、六月，齊侯來獻戎捷。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"齊，大國也，曷為親來獻戎捷？威我也。其威我奈何？旗獲而過我也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"五、秋，築臺于秦。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？臨國也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"六、冬，不雨。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_60_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_60","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}